{"id":"1bab78124334e27a","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-plane-orientation.md","title":"Orientation of Plane Homeomorphisms","display":"df-plane-orientation — Orientation of Plane Homeomorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-plane-orientation","aliases":["58-df-plane-orientation"],"display":"df-plane-orientation — Orientation of Plane Homeomorphisms","depends_on":["[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-plane-orientation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-plane-orientation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-plane-orientation — Orientation of Plane Homeomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,\\gamma,a,k,x,r\\in V\">\\(h,\\gamma,a,k,x,r\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(I=[0,1]\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_2=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^2,2)\">\\(\\tau_2=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^2,2)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词；保留已有的两个定向谓词名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r)\\)</span> 的参数域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R^2\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为其定义域包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,x,y)\\le r\\}\">\\(\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,x,y)\\le r\\}\\)</span> 的函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}winding\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S(k,\\gamma,a)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in\\mathbb R^2\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,I,\\mathbb R^2\\setminus\\{a\\})\n\\land\\gamma(0)=\\gamma(1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(|u-t|&lt;\\delta\\to\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(u),\\gamma(t))&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in I\\;\n(|u-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|\\theta(u)-\\theta(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\theta(1)-\\theta(0)=k\n\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\gamma(t)(0)-a(0)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(t),a)\\cos(2\\pi\\theta(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\gamma(t)(1)-a(1)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(t),a)\\sin(2\\pi\\theta(t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}winding\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S(k,\\gamma,a)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in\\mathbb R^2\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,I,\\mathbb R^2\\setminus\\{a\\})\n\\land\\gamma(0)=\\gamma(1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(|u-t|&lt;\\delta\\to\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(u),\\gamma(t))&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in I\\;\n(|u-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|\\theta(u)-\\theta(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\theta(1)-\\theta(0)=k\n\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\gamma(t)(0)-a(0)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(t),a)\\cos(2\\pi\\theta(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\gamma(t)(1)-a(1)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(t),a)\\sin(2\\pi\\theta(t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}circle\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,h\\!\\left(\\{\\langle0,x(0)+r\\cos(2\\pi t)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,x(1)+r\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle\\}\\right)\\right\\rangle:t\\in I\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}circle\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,h\\!\\left(\\{\\langle0,x(0)+r\\cos(2\\pi t)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,x(1)+r\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle\\}\\right)\\right\\rangle:t\\in I\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}orientation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau_2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,U,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(U,2),\nW,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(W,2))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,x,y)\\le r\\}\\subseteq U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S(1,\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r),h(x))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}orientation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau_2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,U,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(U,2),\nW,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(W,2))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,x,y)\\le r\\}\\subseteq U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S(1,\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r),h(x))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}orientation\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S(h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}orientation\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S(h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>定义使用连续辐角提升得到的绕数，适用于拓扑同胚，不把同胚偷换成可微映射。</li>\n<li>空开集之间的空同胚满足定向条件，因此不相交图册的空过渡域不会造成未定义项。</li>\n<li>两个旧定向符号在本文件具有同一精确定义；名称中的 meta 不再表示未给出的数学原语。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"h,\\gamma,a,k,x,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,1]\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_2=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^2,2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R^2","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,x,y)\\le r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}winding\\text{-}number}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S(k,\\gamma,a)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in\\mathbb R^2\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,I,\\mathbb R^2\\setminus\\{a\\})\n\\land\\gamma(0)=\\gamma(1)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(|u-t|<\\delta\\to\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(u),\\gamma(t))<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in I\\;\n(|u-t|<\\delta\\to|\\theta(u)-\\theta(t)|<\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\theta(1)-\\theta(0)=k\n\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\gamma(t)(0)-a(0)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(t),a)\\cos(2\\pi\\theta(t))\\\\\n&\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\gamma(t)(1)-a(1)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,\\gamma(t),a)\\sin(2\\pi\\theta(t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}circle\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,h\\!\\left(\\{\\langle0,x(0)+r\\cos(2\\pi t)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,x(1)+r\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle\\}\\right)\\right\\rangle:t\\in I\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}orientation}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,W\\in\\tau_2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,U,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(U,2),\nW,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(W,2))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^2:\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(2,x,y)\\le r\\}\\subseteq U\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{PlaneWindingNumber}_S(1,\\mathrm{PlaneCircleImage}_S(h,x,r),h(x))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}orientation\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_S(h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{OrientationPreserving}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(h).","display":true}],"bytes":3366,"backlinks":[{"id":"07a09ca243e6c6a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1c77a2d71bd8704e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-957","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-plane-orientation.md|58-df-plane-orientation]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["ca7fc3ab38a11801","c4b4a825f2ea608d","36d7463d215be751"]}